# Reused component geometry with native revolute occurrence solving.
PROJECT assembly_instances
UNITS mm

POINT3 origin 0 mm 0 mm 0 mm
POINT3 station_a 20 mm 0 mm 0 mm
POINT3 station_b 40 mm 0 mm 0 mm
VECTOR hinge_axis 0 0 1

MATERIAL alloy ALUMINUM
BODY link_definition
MATERIAL alloy
FEATURE stock
TYPE BOX
WIDTH 10 mm
DEPTH 10 mm
HEIGHT 10 mm
END
END

INSTANCE link_a OF link_definition AT station_a ROTATION 0 deg 0 deg 0 deg
INSTANCE link_b OF link_definition AT station_b ROTATION 0 deg 0 deg 0 deg
JOINT mount FIXED WORLD link_a AT station_a AXIS hinge_axis
JOINT hinge REVOLUTE link_a link_b AT station_b AXIS hinge_axis VALUE 90 deg LIMIT -90 deg 90 deg
